                        "entry_id": "2a8e073a-f16f-379b-ae96-8493ac645d51",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The mating of a cow with a bull."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c883266-144f-44f2-8317-426dfddb1e97",
                                "sense_id": "2f6f6b81-60f8-31fe-91b6-c113cb9309cd",
                                "text": "Much difference of opinion exists as to the number of bullings a cow should receive. Here, I think, good judgment should be used. If the bull is cool and quiet, and some time has intervened since he had his last cow, one good leap is better than more […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a12a1f1-2396-4d39-a430-48ca01972de3",
                                "sense_id": "2f6f6b81-60f8-31fe-91b6-c113cb9309cd",
                                "text": "The herdsman left last autumn, and by his leaving the dates of service were lost, and the bullings of only a few cows could be given."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
